  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Early Warning Early Action (EWEA) Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Without putting governments in the driving seat, Early Action will not reach the scale and impact demanded by the worsening climate crisis. The Risk Informed Early Action Partnership seeks to address this challenge through targeted and impactful use of funding provided by FCDO, through initiator activities targeted at Global majority relevant actors. The Early Warning Early Action Fund, implemented by BRC, disburses these funds.</narrative>
  </description>
